</path>
</svg>Vista previa</a>
</div>
</div>
<nav aria-label="Secciones de la galería" data-scroll-x="" class="border-grey-200 -mx-4 overflow-x-auto border-b px-4 [scrollbar-width:none] md:mx-0 md:px-0 [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden">
<div class="flex min-w-max gap-1 md:gap-6">
<a aria-current="page" class="text-micro -mb-px flex min-h-tap items-center gap-1.5 border-b-2 px-2 uppercase md:px-0 md:py-3 border-ink text-ink" href="/admin/g/g1" data-discover="true">Datos</a>
<a class="text-micro -mb-px flex min-h-tap items-center gap-1.5 border-b-2 px-2 uppercase md:px-0 md:py-3 text-grey-700 hover:text-ink border-transparent" href="/admin/g/g1?tab=fotos" data-discover="true">Fotos</a>
<a class="text-micro -mb-px flex min-h-tap items-center gap-1.5 border-b-2 px-2 uppercase md:px-0 md:py-3 text-grey-700 hover:text-ink border-transparent" href="/admin/g/g1?tab=portada" data-discover="true">Portada</a>
<a class="text-micro -mb-px flex min-h-tap items-center gap-1.5 border-b-2 px-2 uppercase md:px-0 md:py-3 text-grey-700 hover:text-ink border-transparent" href="/admin/g/g1?tab=diseno" data-discover="true">Diseño</a>
<a class="text-micro -mb-px flex min-h-tap items-center gap-1.5 border-b-2 px-2 uppercase md:px-0 md:py-3 text-grey-700 hover:text-ink border-transparent" href="/admin/g/g1?tab=compartir" data-discover="true">Compartir</a>
<a class="text-micro -mb-px flex min-h-tap items-center gap-1.5 border-b-2 px-2 uppercase md:px-0 md:py-3 text-grey-700 hover:text-ink border-transparent" href="/admin/g/g1/activity" data-discover="true">Actividad</a>
<a class="text-micro -mb-px flex min-h-tap items-center gap-1.5 border-b-2 px-2 uppercase md:px-0 md:py-3 text-grey-700 hover:text-ink border-transparent" href="/admin/g/g1/favorites" data-discover="true">Favoritos</a>
</div>
</nav>
<div data-editor-grid="" class="grid items-start gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:gap-10 2xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,5fr)_minmax(0,6fr)]">
<div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-8">
<section class="border-grey-200 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t pt-6 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0">
<h2 class="text-micro text-grey-700 uppercase">Datos</h2>
<form method="post" action="/admin/g/g1" class="flex flex-col gap-4" data-discover="true">
<input type="hidden" value="details" name="intent">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
<label for="ID1" class="text-small">Título</label>
<input id="ID1" required="" maxlength="120" class="border-grey-300 bg-white w-full border px-3 py-2 text-body aria-invalid:border-ink aria-invalid:border-2 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ink" value="Boda Ana" name="title">
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
<label for="ID2" class="text-small">Dirección web</label>
<input id="ID2" aria-describedby="ID2-hint" required="" maxlength="60" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false" class="border-grey-300 bg-white w-full border px-3 py-2 text-body aria-invalid:border-ink aria-invalid:border-2 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ink" value="boda-ana" name="slug">
<p id="ID2-hint" class="text-small text-grey-600">Es la última parte del enlace de la galería (por ejemplo, boda-ana). Si la cambiás, los enlaces y códigos QR ya compartidos dejarán de funcionar.</p>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
<label for="ID3" class="text-small">Cliente (solo para vos)</label>
<input id="ID3" aria-describedby="ID3-hint" maxlength="120" class="border-grey-300 bg-white w-full border px-3 py-2 text-body aria-invalid:border-ink aria-invalid:border-2 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ink" value="Ana" name="clientName">
<p id="ID3-hint" class="text-small text-grey-600">Solo lo ves vos en el panel: no se muestra a los clientes ni a quien abra la galería.</p>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
<label for="ID4" class="text-small">Fecha del evento</label>
<input id="ID4" class="border-grey-300 bg-white w-full border px-3 py-2 text-body aria-invalid:border-ink aria-invalid:border-2 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ink" type="date" value="2026-11-01" name="eventDate">
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
<div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
<label for="ID5" class="text-small">Vence (fecha)</label>
<input id="ID5" aria-describedby="expires-note" class="border-grey-300 bg-white w-full border px-3 py-2 text-body aria-invalid:border-ink aria-invalid:border-2 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ink" type="date" value="2026-12-24" name="expiresDate">
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
<label for="ID6" class="text-small">Vence (hora)</label>
<input id="ID6" aria-describedby="expires-note" class="border-grey-300 bg-white w-full border px-3 py-2 text-body aria-invalid:border-ink aria-invalid:border-2 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ink" type="time" value="18:30" name="expiresTime">
</div>
</div>
<p id="expires-note" class="text-small text-grey-600">Hora local del estudio. Vacío = nunca vence. Sin hora, vence al final del día.</p>
</div>
<div>
<button type="submit" class="text-micro uppercase border border-ink min-h-tap px-4 disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ink md:min-h-10 bg-ink text-paper">Guardar datos</button>
</div>
</form>
</section>
<section class="border-grey-200 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t pt-6 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0">
<h2 class="text-micro text-grey-700 uppercase">Estado</h2>
<p class="text-small text-grey-700">Solo las galerías publicadas y sin vencer son visibles para los clientes.</p>
<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
<form method="post" action="/admin/g/g1" data-discover="true">
<input type="hidden" value="status" name="intent">
<input type="hidden" value="restore" name="to">
<button type="submit" class="text-micro uppercase border border-ink min-h-tap px-4 disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ink md:min-h-10">Restaurar</button>
</form>
</div>
</section>
<section class="border-grey-200 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t pt-6 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0">
<h2 class="text-micro text-grey-700 uppercase">PIN de acceso</h2>
<p class="text-body">Sin PIN</p>
<p class="text-small text-grey-600">Cambiar o quitar el PIN cierra las sesiones de los clientes y anula los enlaces de descarga ya emitidos.</p>
<form method="post" action="/admin/g/g1" class="flex flex-col gap-3" data-discover="true">
<input type="hidden" value="pin" name="intent">
<input type="hidden" value="set" name="mode">
<div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
<label for="ID7" class="text-small">Nuevo PIN</label>
<input id="ID7" aria-describedby="ID7-hint" required="" minlength="6" maxlength="32" autocomplete="new-password" class="border-grey-300 bg-white w-full border px-3 py-2 text-body aria-invalid:border-ink aria-invalid:border-2 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ink" type="password" name="pin">
<p id="ID7-hint" class="text-small text-grey-600">De 6 a 32 caracteres.</p>
</div>
<div>
<button type="submit" class="text-micro uppercase border border-ink min-h-tap px-4 disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ink md:min-h-10 bg-ink text-paper">Guardar PIN</button>
</div>
</form>
</section>
<section class="border-grey-200 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t pt-6 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0">
<h2 class="text-micro text-grey-700 uppercase">Portada pública</h2>
<form method="post" action="/admin/g/g1" class="flex flex-col gap-3" data-discover="true">
<input type="hidden" value="home" name="intent">
<input type="hidden" value="0" name="showOnHome">
<div class="flex items-start gap-2">
<input id="show-on-home" disabled="" aria-describedby="show-on-home-hint" class="mt-2.5 size-6 md:mt-1 md:size-4" type="checkbox" value="1" name="showOnHome">
<div>
<label for="show-on-home" class="text-small flex min-h-tap items-center md:min-h-0">Mostrar en la portada</label>
<p id="show-on-home-hint" class="text-small text-grey-600">No disponible: la galería no está publicada.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div>
<button type="submit" class="text-micro uppercase border border-ink min-h-tap px-4 disabled:opacity-40 disabled:cursor-not-allowed focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ink md:min-h-10 bg-ink text-paper" disabled="">Guardar portada pública</button>
</div>
</form>
</section>
<section class="border-grey-200 flex flex-col gap-3 border-t pt-6 first:border-t-0 first:pt-0">
<h2 class="text-micro text-grey-700 uppercase">Opciones</h2>
<form method="post" action="/admin/g/g1" class="flex flex-col gap-3" data-discover="true">
<input type="hidden" value="flags" name="intent">
<fieldset class="flex flex-col gap-2">
<legend class="text-small font-medium">Modo</legend>
<div class="flex items-start gap-2">
<input id="mode-delivery" aria-describedby="mode-delivery-note" class="mt-2.5 size-6 md:mt-1 md:size-4" type="radio" value="delivery" checked="" name="mode">
<div>
