<a class="text-micro -mb-px flex min-h-tap items-center gap-1.5 border-b-2 px-2 uppercase md:px-0 md:py-3 text-grey-700 hover:text-ink border-transparent" href="/admin/g/g1?tab=compartir" data-discover="true">Compartir</a>
